    "jobDescription": "<p class=\"Mso List Paragraph\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !support Lists]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height: 115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">1.<span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\"> </span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Production Line Execution<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Manage day-to-day shift operations for Wave Soldering, Conformal Coating, ICT, and FCT processes.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Ensure production targets are met with proper line balancing and manpower deployment.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Conduct first-piece approvals and validate process parameters before mass production.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso List Paragraph\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !support Lists]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height: 115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">2.<span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\"> </span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Process Setup & Monitoring<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Ensure proper setup of Wave machines, conformal coating machines, and test stations (ICT/FCT).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Monitor parameters such as solder pot temperature, coating thickness, test fixture condition, and functional test cycles.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Coordinate with maintenance and process teams for timely machine readiness and issue resolution.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso List Paragraph\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !support Lists]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height: 115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">3.<span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\"> </span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Quality & First Pass Yield (FPY)<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Monitor and analyze in-process defects such as solder bridges, coating peel-off, ICT open/short, FCT failure, etc.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Collaborate with quality and engineering teams for defect root cause analysis and implementation of CAPA.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Maintain FPY, rework %, and defect trend reports for assigned lines.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso List Paragraph\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !support Lists]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height: 115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">4.<span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\"> </span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Line Documentation and ERP Coordination<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Maintain production logs, operator allocation sheets, rejection reports, and test results.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Ensure real-time data entry in ERP systems (production booking, material consumption, test records).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Prepare daily shift reports and handover documentation for review.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso List Paragraph\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !support Lists]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height: 115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">5.<span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\"> </span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Operator Management and Training<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Guide operators on soldering techniques, masking, coating quality, and testing procedures.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Conduct training on SOPs, test coverage requirements, ESD practices, and safety protocols.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Monitor operator performance and ensure shift discipline and productivity.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso List Paragraph\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !support Lists]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height: 115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">6.<span style=\"font:7.0pt \"Times New Roman\"\"> </span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Safety, 5S, and Compliance<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Ensure adherence to 5S, ESD, and PPE guidelines at coating/test zones and soldering stations.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso Normal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Ensure proper handling of hazardous materials used in coating and cleaning.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"Mso List Paragraph Cx Sp First\" style=\"margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto; text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">• Participate in internal audits and maintain audit-ready documentation.</span></p><ul class=\"Pay Rate Group\"> </ul>",
